    "detailed_description": "<h1>Other Games From Chilla's Art</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>Other Games From Chilla's Art</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>Other Games From Chilla's Art</h1><p><br><br><br> (Published &amp; Developed by NyxTales)</p><br><h1>UPCOMING GAMES</h1><p><br><br> (Published &amp; Developed by NyxTales)</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Jimmu | \u795e\u6b66 is a challenging Japanese horror-themed boss hunting game that takes place in Japan centuries ago. The game features a non-linear open-world with some RPG elements.<br><br>From the creators of<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br>You play as a protagonist named Jimmu who wakes up on an island and finds that the island is cursed with evil creatures. Something big attacks you on the way to a village you saw from a distance. Fortunately, you barely survived the attack and were able to enter the village.<br><br><br>Key Features:<br>Open-world (Island)<br>Non-linear gameplay<br>RPG elements (skill system, financial system, etc)<br>Save system<br>No hand holding<br>Many enemies and bosses<br>Japanese horror-themed suspenseful atmosphere",
